"//! Cgroup v2 Actuator with Strict Safety Whitelist
//!
//! Provides controlled resource bounding via cgroups v2:
//! - CFS bandwidth quota: `cpu.max` (e.g. "50000 100000" or "max 100000")
//! - CFS scheduler priority: `cpu.idle` (0 = standard, 1 = SCHED_IDLE)
//! - Cgroup freezer: `cgroup.freeze` (0 = thawed, 1 = frozen)
//!
//! SAFETY GUARANTEES:
//! - Strictly rejects touching `system.slice`, `init.scope`, `user.slice` root, compositor (Hyprland),
//!   display managers (sddm), audio daemons (pipewire), or D-Bus brokers.
//! - CFS quotas and freezing are strictly confined to whitelisted background slices (e.g. `background.slice`).

